'' A module exports procedures taking and returning span( of long ) (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003
'' §1): the interface writes '__tko_span( of long )', so an importer that declares its own TYPE
'' called span still calls them with array slices, and keeps its own type.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/spanmod/libs tests/modules/src/spanmod/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/spanmod.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/spanmod.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/spanmod.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  10
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7
